Rename the windowing API to the 3.47 stable names for the distribution build.

The editor source tracks the master SDK, where the windowing API dropped the
"Regular" prefix (WindowController, Window, WindowControllerDelegate) and
re-exports ScrollCacheExtent through material.dart. The distribution builds
against 3.47 stable, which still uses the prefixed names and does not
re-export ScrollCacheExtent. package_editor.dart applies this before the
build and reverses it after, so day-to-day development stays on master.
Delete it when the distribution pin moves to a stable that carries the
rename (3.50), where master and stable agree.

